{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mano.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "真乃 · 相遇 · second",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mano.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mano.second",
    "idolId": "mano",
    "startNodeId": "n01",
    "nodes": {
      "n01": {
        "id": "n01",
        "text": "两天后。公园的长椅上，真乃还是坐在原来的位置。鸽子比上次多了一只。",
        "nextNodeId": "n02"
      },
      "n02": {
        "id": "n02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "你来了。",
        "textVariants": [
          {
            "when": [
              {
                "kind": "flag",
                "key": "mano_heard_song",
                "value": true
              }
            ],
            "text": "你来了。上次那首歌……我后来又改了一点。"
          }
        ],
        "nextNodeId": "n03"
      },
      "n03": {
        "id": "n03",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我一直在想，你那天为什么要停下来听。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "因为我想听你唱完",
            "nextNodeId": "n04a",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "因为那首歌让我停下了脚步",
            "nextNodeId": "n04b",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "因为我觉得你还没有唱完",
            "nextNodeId": "n04c",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "n04a": {
        "id": "n04a",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……唱完。我好像很久没有把一首歌唱完了。",
        "nextNodeId": "n05"
      },
      "n04b": {
        "id": "n04b",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "停下脚步……我从来没有想过，会有人这样听。",
        "nextNodeId": "n05"
      },
      "n04c": {
        "id": "n04c",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "还没有唱完……嗯。也许是这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "n05"
      },
      "n05": {
        "id": "n05",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我从小就喜欢唱歌。但是，站在别人面前的时候，就会不知道该怎么办。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n06": {
        "id": "n06",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "所以那天，我才说了那种话。对不起。",
        "nextNodeId": "n07"
      },
      "n07": {
        "id": "n07",
        "speakerId": "tsutomu",
        "text": "真乃。你不用为没有准备好道歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "n08"
      },
      "n08": {
        "id": "n08",
        "speakerId": "tsutomu",
        "text": "但如果你愿意试着改变，283 会接住你。",
        "nextNodeId": "n09"
      },
      "n09": {
        "id": "n09",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "n10"
      },
      "n10": {
        "id": "n10",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我想试试。不是为了成为很厉害的人，只是想……把这首歌唱完。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "我会陪你到最后",
            "nextNodeId": "n11a",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "先从第一步开始",
            "nextNodeId": "n11b",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "n11a": {
        "id": "n11a",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……嗯。那就请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "n12"
      },
      "n11b": {
        "id": "n11b",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "第一步……我可以做到吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "n12"
      },
      "n12": {
        "id": "n12",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "樱木真乃。从今天开始，请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "n13"
      },
      "n13": {
        "id": "n13",
        "text": "她站起来，认真地向你鞠了一躬。公园里的鸽子扑棱棱飞起，又落在她脚边。"
      }
    }
  },
